flowchart TB
    A[Ad Request] --> B[Consent + Eligibility]
    B --> C[Frequency Cap + Targeting]
    C --> D[Ad Pod Decision]
    D --> E{Failure?}
    E -- No --> F[Serve Ads + Measure]
    E -- Yes --> G[Safe Mode]
    G --> H[Shorten Pod / House Ad / Slate / Skip]
    H --> R[Ad Decision Replay Receipt]
    F --> R
